#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-adc.rst:5 7b0efc16f981424e85ebedfd24c3d522
msgid ""
"Avionics Anonymous Air Data Computer - Airspeed, Barometer, and Air "
"Temperature"
msgstr "Avionics Anonymous 空中数据计算机 — 空速、气压计与空气温度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-adc.rst:7 81b65288b80e403da8f524d45279a9e1
msgid ""
"The `Avionics Anonymous Air Data Computer "
"<https://docs.avionicsanonymous.com/devices/microadc>`__ is tiny, richly-"
"featured Air Data Computer (ADC) for small unmanned airplanes. It includes "
"an MS5611 barometric pressure sensor for 10cm-resolution altitude, a "
"Honeywell RSC-series differential pressure transducer for extremely accurate"
" airspeed, and a thermistor interface with high-resolution convertor for air"
" temperature measurement with better than 1 degree precision. The device "
"interfaces to your autopilot via a robust `DroneCAN "
"<https://dronecan.org>`__ interface, which provides high reliability "
"connections to peripherals over greater distances than I2C."
msgstr ""
"`Avionics Anonymous 空中数据计算机 "
"<https://docs.avionicsanonymous.com/devices/microadc>`__ "
"是一款体积微小、功能丰富的小型无人机空中数据计算机（ADC）。它集成了 MS5611 气压传感器（10cm 分辨率高度）、Honeywell RSC "
"系列差压传感器（高精度空速）以及带高分辨率转换器的热敏电阻接口（优于 1 度精度的空气温度测量）。设备通过稳健的 `DroneCAN "
"<https://dronecan.org>`__ 接口与飞控通信，比 I2C 提供更高可靠性和更远连接距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-adc.rst:18 bc924afaa7624deebeb100d3d4943274
msgid ""
"Avionics Anonymous Air Data Computer: Airspeed, Barometer, and Air "
"Temperature"
msgstr "Avionics Anonymous 空中数据计算机：空速、气压计与空气温度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-adc.rst:20 c10e5ca446154258ab4119cfd795b4db
msgid ""
"The following parameter should be set on the autopilot (and then reboot the "
"autopilot):"
msgstr "应在飞控上设置以下参数（然后重启飞控）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-adc.rst:22 e15e45d0e7f24a42b0823a9a2d85d970
msgid ":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1 (to enable the 1st CAN port)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1（启用第一路 CAN 端口）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-adc.rst:24 02aae5c7f6464a8c800496817cdf540e
msgid ""
"If the device does not work please follow the instructions on enabling the "
"CANBUS in the :ref:`common-canbus-setup-advanced` page, followed by "
":ref:`common-uavcan-setup-advanced` steps."
msgstr ""
"如果设备无法工作，请按照 :ref:`common-canbus-setup-advanced` 页面上的 CANBUS 启用说明操作，然后执行 "
":ref:`common-uavcan-setup-advanced` 步骤。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-adc.rst:26 34be6122d0fd4459a7003e4ecdc4b174
msgid ""
"The `manufacturer's product page is here "
"<https://docs.avionicsanonymous.com/devices/microadc>`__ for general "
